R Interface to 'JDemetra+ 3.x' (\url{https://github.com/jdemetra}) time series analysis software. It provides functions allowing to model time series (create outlier regressors, user-defined calendar regressors, Unobserved Components AutoRegressive Integrated Moving Average (UCARIMA) models...), to test the presence of trading days or seasonal effects and also to set specifications in pre-adjustment and benchmarking when using 'rjd3x13' or 'rjd3tramoseats'.
